msgctxt "Words"
msgid ""
"The phone's copy of this vault, its Secret Key and its phone unlock are "
"deleted from this phone. The vault stays on your computer and your other "
"devices; a change made here that hasn't synced yet is lost."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:214
msgctxt "Words"
msgid ""
"This phone stops sending and fetching changes and forgets its key for the "
"server. The vault stays on the phone and on your other devices; joining "
"again needs a new invite."
