#: ui/app.slint:4556
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Every device keeps the whole vault and works offline. Syncing only moves "
"sealed copies: each device writes its own copy, reads the others' and merges "
"them in. When two devices changed the same login, the newer change wins and "
"the other password goes into the login's history, so nothing is lost."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:4562
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Your vault server: a small program you run yourself (Docker, reached over "
"Tailscale or with its own HTTPS). It keeps one sealed copy per device and "
"the devices' public keys, and never anything that opens the vault. A device "
"joins with a one-time invite from a device already in."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:4568
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Neither place can open the vault, put an older copy back or add a device of "
"its own: every device checks each copy with the vault's own key, and "
"remembers the newest one it saw from every other device."
msgstr ""

